# TA-2 (class test area, map 13, .tele classtest): the Knockback Training Dummy, fl-customnpc entry 920021
# (C++ AI npc_fl_knockback_dummy), played by server-side test bots (mod-fl-testbots, T1).
# Two identical copies: fl-customnpc tests/ (next to the code) and mod-woodworking tests/ (the folder the runner
# reads until TestBots.ScenarioDirs lists fl-customnpc/tests) - change both together.
#   1  in combat: a knockback (Thunderstorm 59159, 30 yd/s, ~19 yd) moves the dummy; the AI teleports it back to its
#      spawn point within 10 s of the combat start (<= 11 s after the knock), facing restored, still in combat.
#      Lightning Bolt (49238) hits keep the combat alive (the stock dummy's 5 s rule).
#   2  out of combat: knocked back once more and then left alone, it leaves combat 5 s later and is home at once
#      (the evade path; the 10 s in-combat timer cannot have fired yet).
#   3  an existing TA-1 dummy (L80, 920008, rooted) does not move under the same knockback (it is hit: in combat).
# Distances are the director's `.distance` "(3D)" value (centre distance minus both combat reaches): the director
# stands 6 yd west of the dummy, the shaman 3 yd west of it, so the knock carries the dummy away from both.
name    TA-2 knockback training dummy: knocked back, home within 10 s in combat, home on evade; L80 dummy unchanged
timeout 120s
group   party
bot sh shaman

place 13 -245 -289 -422.72
pick kb creature:920021
require kb exists
pick d80 creature:920008
require d80 exists
track kb
track d80
waitfor kb outofcombat timeout 10s
require kb near -245 -295 -423.22 0.5
mark home

# --- 1: knockback in combat, back home by the 10 s timer, still in combat ----------------------------------------
# `approach` is a near teleport that lands only when the bot manager acknowledges it on the bot's next update; a cast
# in the same tick still sees the old position and facing (run 311: SPELL_FAILED_UNIT_NOT_INFRONT 134). Settle 1 s,
# then a second bolt 0.5 s after the first as a retry (a second hit only keeps the combat, which is wanted anyway).
do sh approach kb 3
wait 1s
do sh cast 49238 on kb triggered
wait 500ms
do sh cast 49238 on kb triggered
wait 1s
waitfor kb incombat timeout 2s
do gm target kb
as gm .distance
log before the knockback (director to dummy)
expect output value (3D) < 9
do sh cast 59159 triggered
wait 1500ms
do gm target kb
as gm .distance
log 1.5 s after Thunderstorm
expect output value (3D) > 15
expect kb incombat
do sh cast 49238 on kb triggered
wait 2500ms
do sh cast 49238 on kb triggered
wait 2500ms
do sh cast 49238 on kb triggered
log waiting for the in-combat return (the knock was ~6.5 s ago; the timer fires 10 s after the combat start)
waitfor kb at home 1 timeout 4s
expect kb incombat
do gm target kb
as gm .gps
log facing after the return (spawn orientation 1.5708)
expect output value Orientation > 1.56
expect output value Orientation < 1.58
wait 2s
log 2 s later: no chase, no attack
expect kb at home 0.5
expect kb alive
expect kb health == 100%
expect sh health == 100%

# --- 2: out of combat: the evade takes it home -------------------------------------------------------------------
waitfor kb outofcombat timeout 8s
expect kb at home 1
do sh cast 59159 triggered
wait 1500ms
do gm target kb
as gm .distance
log 1.5 s after the second Thunderstorm (no further hits)
expect output value (3D) > 15
expect kb incombat
waitfor kb outofcombat timeout 6s
log combat over: home at once
expect kb at home 1
expect kb alive

# --- 3: the existing L80 Training Dummy is unchanged (rooted, not knocked back) ---------------------------------
# The shaman must really stand next to it before Thunderstorm (radius 10 yd): wait until the approach teleport has
# landed (128 yd from the knockback square). `incombat` is the evidence that the Thunderstorm reached the dummy -
# without it "did not move" proves nothing (run 311 cast before the teleport landed, from 128 yd away).
do sh approach d80 3
waitfor sh near -200 -175 -423.22 4 timeout 3s
wait 500ms
do sh cast 59159 triggered
wait 1500ms
log L80 dummy 1.5 s after Thunderstorm
expect d80 incombat
expect d80 at home 0.2
expect d80 near -200 -175 -423.22 0.2
expect d80 health == 100%

cleanup
do sh stop
waitfor kb outofcombat timeout 10s
expect kb at home 1
log done
